<h2 dir="auto">Get Started Today</h2>
<ol dir="auto">
<li><strong>Choose your plan</strong> — <a href="https://github.blog/news-insights/product-news/github-copilot-in-vscode-free/" rel="nofollow">Free</a> or <a href="https://github.com/github-copilot/signup">Pro ($20/month)</a></li>
<li><strong>Install your IDE extension</strong> — <a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=GitHub.copilot" rel="nofollow">VS Code</a>, <a href="https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/" rel="nofollow">Visual Studio</a>, <a href="https://plugins.jetbrains.com/plugin/17718-github-copilot" rel="nofollow">JetBrains</a>, or <a href="https://github.com/features/copilot">other IDEs</a></li>
<li><strong>Sign in</strong> — Use your GitHub account</li>
<li><strong>Start coding</strong> — Copilot will offer suggestions and answer questions</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Not sure where to start?</strong></p>
